# LLM layer
- Provider interface with MockProvider (default) and one real provider chosen by LLM_PROVIDER
  (mock | anthropic | gemini | openai | sarvam). Keys only from env vars, never committed.
- Tasks: extract_profile (JSON with allowed keys only, Pydantic-validated), explain_eligibility,
  explain_why_not, draft_pack. Prompts are in AGENTS.md 2.5.
- guard.py: reject any output containing a number that is not in the input facts; fall back to
  the template text. Explanations must end with "Source: <source title>".
- The LLM receives only structured facts (scheme JSON, criterion results, needed profile fields).
- Drafts are watermarked DRAFT and use [fill in] placeholders for missing data.
- Timeouts and errors fall back to MockProvider output; the UI never breaks.
